+    }
+    // ARRANGEMENT COMPLETION (symwalk): the pre-split PSLG (pushChain + snap) can
+    // still carry proper crossings of its symbolic seam sub-edges - the gap-free
+    // scale-free wedge cluster (pivot HALF-1) whose triple points ExactSeamsCross's
+    // triangle-clip declined.  Find them exactly (properCrossH), construct the
+    // once-only triple point cramer{f,g,h} of the two crossing seams' distinct
